#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom/scripts.inc:455
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom_Text_HoldMonsChooseFromSelection"
msgid ""
"First, we will hold your POKéMON for\n"
"safekeeping.\p"
"You may then choose from our\n"
"selection of POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"首先，我们会替你\n"
"保管你的宝可梦。\p"
"然后，你可以从我们准备的\n"
"宝可梦中进行挑选。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom/scripts.inc:461
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom_Text_LetUsRestoreMons"
msgid ""
"Thank you for competing!\n"
"Let us restore your POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你的参赛！\n"
"让我们为你的宝可梦恢复健康！$"

